intro_en:
In the late Qing, to promote the revolution, Zhang Taiyan wrote in his declaration for the "Commemoration of the 242nd Anniversary of the Fall of China":
May our people of Yunnan never forget Li Dingguo;
May our people of Fujian never forget Zheng Chenggong;
May our people of Zhejiang never forget Zhang Huangyan;
May our people of Guangxi never forget Qu Shisi;
May our people of Chu never forget He Tengjiao;
May our people of Liaodong never forget Li Chengliang.

Zhang Huangyan (Cangshui) played a key role in the resistance against the Qing at the end of the Ming. This session will introduce his activities and discuss his writings.
